---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="System Stops Here — kalam.ch" description="Where dignity reaches zero, the system stops. These are the coordinates of failure.">

  <section class="page-header">
    <h1>System Stops Here</h1>
    <p class="quiet">Where dignity reaches zero, the system stops. These are the coordinates of failure.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <section class="gallery-intro">
    <div class="text-block">
      <p>Each card below describes a computational system and the exact moment it would be halted by the dignity predicate <strong>D = A &times; L &times; M</strong>. The zeros are not in the people. They are in the institutions that could not read them.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <section class="gallery-grid">

    <article class="halt-card halt-m">
      <div class="halt-meter">
        <div class="halt-bar halt-bar-a"><div class="halt-fill" style="height:80%"></div><span>A</span></div>
        <div class="halt-bar halt-bar-l"><div class="halt-fill" style="height:60%"></div><span>L</span></div>
        <div class="halt-bar halt-bar-m"><div class="halt-fill" style="height:0%"></div><span>M</span></div>
      </div>
      <h2 class="halt-title">Predictive Policing Dashboard</h2>
      <p class="halt-desc">A city deploys an algorithm that scores neighbourhoods by "crime risk." The score correlates with poverty and ethnicity. Residents are surveilled without suspicion.</p>
      <p class="halt-zero"><strong>M reached zero</strong> when the system treated entire communities as threat vectors rather than people.</p>
      <p class="halt-action">The system stops. It does not optimise. It witnesses the failure and opens a remedy path.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="halt-card halt-l">
      <div class="halt-meter">
        <div class="halt-bar halt-bar-a"><div class="halt-fill" style="height:70%"></div><span>A</span></div>
        <div class="halt-bar halt-bar-l"><div class="halt-fill" style="height:0%"></div><span>L</span></div>
        <div class="halt-bar halt-bar-m"><div class="halt-fill" style="height:90%"></div><span>M</span></div>
      </div>
      <h2 class="halt-title">Dynamic Welfare Scoring</h2>
      <p class="halt-desc">A benefits system auto-assigns risk scores to claimants. A single mother with an irregular work history is flagged as "high fraud risk." Her context is invisible to the model.</p>
      <p class="halt-zero"><strong>L reached zero</strong> when the system could not see the person behind the pattern — only the deviation from its norm.</p>
      <p class="halt-action">The system stops. It does not deny. It halts and asks: what am I not seeing?</p>
    </article>

    <article class="halt-card halt-a">
      <div class="halt-meter">
        <div class="halt-bar halt-bar-a"><div class="halt-fill" style="height:0%"></div><span>A</span></div>
        <div class="halt-bar halt-bar-l"><div class="halt-fill" style="height:85%"></div><span>L</span></div>
        <div class="halt-bar halt-bar-m"><div class="halt-fill" style="height:75%"></div><span>M</span></div>
      </div>
      <h2 class="halt-title">School Placement Algorithm</h2>
      <p class="halt-desc">A centralised system assigns children to schools. Parents cannot appeal, cannot see the criteria, cannot redirect. The algorithm decides. The family receives a letter.</p>
      <p class="halt-zero"><strong>A reached zero</strong> when the system removed the family's ability to say 'stop' or 'wait' — to be agents in their own child's future.</p>
      <p class="halt-action">The system stops. It does not place. It opens a path for the family to speak.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="halt-card halt-all">
      <div class="halt-meter">
        <div class="halt-bar halt-bar-a"><div class="halt-fill" style="height:0%"></div><span>A</span></div>
        <div class="halt-bar halt-bar-l"><div class="halt-fill" style="height:0%"></div><span>L</span></div>
        <div class="halt-bar halt-bar-m"><div class="halt-fill" style="height:0%"></div><span>M</span></div>
      </div>
      <h2 class="halt-title">Custody Evaluation System</h2>
      <p class="halt-desc">A father separated from his children enters a system that scores "parental fitness." He cannot challenge the score. His cultural context is unreadable. He is reduced to a case number.</p>
      <p class="halt-zero"><strong>All dimensions reached zero.</strong> Agency: he cannot redirect. Legibility: his context is invisible. Moral standing: he is a number, not a father.</p>
      <p class="halt-action">The system stops completely. It generates a witness certificate — a record that says: here is where the institution failed to see a human being.</p>
    </article>

  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <section class="gallery-closing">
    <p class="proverb">"The certificate is not proof that dignity existed.<br/>It is proof that the system tried to see, and where it could not, it stopped rather than pretend."</p>
  </section>

</Base>

<style>
  .gallery-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--page-padding);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .gallery-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      max-width: 80ch;
    }
  }

  .halt-card {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent-subtle);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: var(--space-3);
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .halt-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-dignity);
  }

  .halt-card.halt-all {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    border-color: rgba(196, 74, 26, 0.3);
  }

  /* Mini meter in each card */
  .halt-meter {
    display: flex;
    gap: 5px;
    align-items: flex-end;
    height: 28px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .halt-bar {
    width: 6px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: var(--bg-primary);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .halt-bar span {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -14px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .halt-fill {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    border-radius: 3px;
    transition: height 0.8s ease;
  }

  .halt-bar-a .halt-fill { background: var(--color-dignity); }
  .halt-bar-l .halt-fill { background: var(--color-presence); }
  .halt-bar-m .halt-fill { background: var(--color-wisdom); }

  .halt-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: var(--space-2) 0 var(--space-1);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .halt-desc {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .halt-zero {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-dignity);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
  }

  .halt-zero strong {
    color: var(--danger, #c45050);
  }

  .halt-action {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .gallery-intro {
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--page-padding);
  }

  .gallery-closing {
    max-width: 50ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0 var(--page-padding);
  }
</style>
